    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JCJJSXJGPFWCVAW2FK3FC8FE\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to create a campaign using the campaigns library which will set up a segment of profiles as your audience as well as message content based on your marketing goal. The library is available for both email and SMS campaigns.</p>\n<p>Campaign goals include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Promote a product</li>\n<li>Launch a sale</li>\n<li>Engage your subscribers</li>\n<li>Share an exclusive offer</li>\n<li>Share a business update</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Using templates from the library makes it easier and faster to create campaigns for your subscribers. This is a great starting point for choosing an audience and message content which you can further customize for your brand.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JCJJSXJGTMFS25BQW0WHT9HF\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>If you haven't already, learn the basics of creating a campaign:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005054847\">How to create and send an email campaign</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040039971\">How to create and send an SMS campaign</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JCJJSXJG9HK8WWNYRGSJDHYJ\">Explore the campaigns library</h2>\n<p>To explore the campaigns library:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Campaigns</strong> tab in Klaviyo.</li>\n<li>At the top, click <strong>Library</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32781078342939\" alt=\"\" width=\"462\" height=\"100\">\n</li>\n<li>Use the <strong>Channel </strong>dropdown to filter between email and SMS campaigns.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32757153452059\" alt=\"\" width=\"542\" height=\"302\">\n</li>\n<li>Use the search bar to find a specific kind of campaign or click <strong>Campaign goal</strong> to filter based on goals.<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/30892315131035\" alt=\"\" width=\"505\" height=\"403\">\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Campaign templates will appear based on metric data in your account. For example, templates related to <em>Placed Order </em>events will only appear if you have order data in your account.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Once you find a campaign template you like, click on it to review the details.<br>\n<br>\nOn the left is a description of the campaign and related tags. Under <em>Audience</em> is the definition of the segment to which the campaign will be sent.<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/30892315132571\" alt=\"\">\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Segments created by the campaigns library will remain in your account so they can be used in future campaigns. If you create a campaign from the library that uses the same segment definition as a campaign you’ve created before, it will reuse the existing segment rather than creating a new one.</p>\n<p>On the right is an estimate of the audience size and a preview of the email content used in the campaign.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create &amp; customize</strong> in the top right to continue to the campaign setup wizard.</li>\n</ol>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
